Opt-in flag for the i-have-adhd plugin's always-on mode.

setup-claude.sh links this to ~/.claude/.i-have-adhd-always. The plugin's
SessionStart hook checks only that the path exists and never reads the
contents, then injects the full ADHD ruleset at the top of every session.

Delete the symlink to turn always-on off, or say "stop adhd mode" to turn it
off for one session.
